            <ArticleTitle>Late stent thrombosis after implantation of a sirolimus-eluting stent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>505-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Late stent thrombosis in the era of routine high-pressure stent deployment and combined antiplatelet therapy with thienopyridines and aspirin has become a rare but feared complication. We describe a patient with acute myocardial infarction due to late stent thrombosis 6 weeks after deployment of a sirolimus-eluting stent and 2 weeks after the discontinuation of clopidogrel. This is the first report of late thrombosis of a sirolimus-eluting stent.</AbstractText>
